==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 2 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mareep Drop Event]], which ran from January 1 to 18, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Magikarp|29}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Expert Splasher''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Magikarp|42}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

